---

This project includes a training corpus derived from the public git history of
COBWEB-ca/cobweb2 (https://github.com/COBWEB-ca/cobweb2). That repository
publishes no licence, so no licence terms are claimed for the derived corpus
here; the question is being settled directly with the upstream project.

The corpus is sanitised before publication: third-party contact details that
appear in the project's credits screen are redacted, while contributor names are
kept, since attribution is what a credits screen is for. The repository README
describes the process.

If you hold rights in cobweb2 and have a concern about this material, please
open an issue on this repository.
